{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_03_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7b7a375e3e3255846395cd5c69cbd7ca3cecaf3f612116b931c9afd56dd9ad",
      "text": "没事吧？\n卷绪、咲，不好意思。东云他吃不了红豆馅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:497c4daa56972b6d89022b13ed6e876283738472403c7e9570b51db7126af5a1",
      "text": "哎！？是这样吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf40e03da686d1f7ab21b611abecc06464a69b24c3ed4983d12ea9999ea98c2",
      "text": "是的，其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a6aea69ddfeddc0a27d0b5ac33d1e7a47590062fbeb48133ab7c29c2fe1e4d7",
      "text": "……因为我的老家是开日式点心店的，\n所以曾想方设法试图克服过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f9366434bf6dfcd566d358d990732e69d7beed447cf5589bbf7e8e5ba0d1a4d",
      "text": "但这样逼迫自己的结果，反倒变得越来越应付不来了。\n……吓到你们真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a3d9bcd7a1e69eb18df64bb83a4defdb1aaac536eca9662986e9330b0ebb9be",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n对不起哦，庄一郎……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd4d8aefce74daa346b16715fcaf7486877bbc48918eb76d659615dbdefb6894",
      "text": "我也，非常抱歉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6a65c3d2457f4973bd06ae305eb13046cd98205582fd6a90083784096ca475",
      "text": "不，该道歉的是我。而且二位希望能为店里\n出力的心意，我很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f744464f67ec6d54e71335db165763ff88c7fe2ccc8c6bfc6c8c2fa585e41d61",
      "text": "看来我同意雇佣二位来打工的眼光，\n并没有出错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc20f12cb07271a4e616039dd9798a70fc4a8d5fb0f793d5368ba4ac1201d066",
      "text": "那么，庄一郎先生的那份就由我来吃！\n考察也请交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_h:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed00e9bc379c51180cfaeca4a56679abf536c7b3b61b6e4a971b57229ae462d",
      "text": "好，那就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
